<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa maize futures turnover hits record in May.</title>
<headline>S.Africa maize futures turnover hits record in May.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's maize futures market, launched last year, notched up record turnover worth 106 million rand in May, the South African Futures Exchange (Safex) said.</p>
<p>Turnover since the beginning of 1997 totalled over 305 million rand, it added.</p>
<p>Deliveries of 44,900 tonnes of maize were made through Safex on the May contracts. --Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
